@startuml 04-npc-progression
!pragma layout smetana
title NPC e progressione - Factory

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class "npcs.yaml" as NpcYaml <<asset>>
class "evolution_rules.yaml" as EvolutionYaml <<asset>>
class NpcFactory <<Factory>>
class Npc <<Prototype>>
class NpcHelpRequestService <<Service>>
class CollectibleFactory <<external>>
class EvolutionService <<Service>>
class EvolutionRuleFactory <<Factory>>

NpcYaml --> NpcFactory
NpcFactory o-- Npc : copie
NpcHelpRequestService --> Npc
NpcHelpRequestService --> CollectibleFactory : reward
NpcHelpRequestService --> EvolutionService : scelta
EvolutionYaml --> EvolutionRuleFactory
EvolutionService --> EvolutionRuleFactory

note bottom of NpcHelpRequestService
Minimo: una scelta NPC aggiorna reward, karma ed evoluzione.
end note
@enduml
